        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Heat, at cogen, biogas agricultural mix, allocation exergy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Heat, at cogen, biogas agricultural mix, allocation exergy
This process gives the mix of heat from biogas from agricultural plants in Switzerland in the year 2006;
UUID: 046f714f-4c6c-3473-a84a-c6456902f932
This process is an assembling process for the different production of heat from biogas
Location: For this process 20 plants in Switzerland producing about 50% of electricity from biogas have been evaluated. 
Technology: Mix of biogas engines and ignition gas engine
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 25 GWh electricity, 12 mio. m3 Biogas 
Sampling: The data are the average of 20 plants in Switzerland 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_046f714f-4c6c-3473-a84a-c6456902f932.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
